{
    "title": "Max: Stream HBO, TV, & Movies",
    "description": "We foresee you enjoying Dune: Prophecy on Max! Stream the epic HBO Original series this November to learn more about the mysterious Sisterhood.\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s all here. Iconic series, award-winning movies, fresh originals, and family favorites, featuring the DC Universe and HBO. Discover the best entertainment for every mood. Max \u2013 the one to watch. Subscribe now! \r\n \r\nWith Max you'll get: \r\n\u2022 Unlimited access to thousands of TV shows and movies.\r\n\u2022 A deep library of brands and studios like HBO, the Wizarding World, HGTV, TLC, Magnolia Network, Food Network, and Adult Swim. \r\n\u2022 The largest streaming library of the DC Universe shows and movies. \r\n\u2022 Hundreds of exclusive original series from HBO and Max.\r\n\u2022 CNN Max, a 24/7 live feed featuring breaking news and coverage of the world\u2019s biggest stories. Now available in beta to all Max subscribers \u2014 at no additional cost.\r\n\u2022 Stream select live sports from your favorite leagues and teams. Sports add-on subscription required. Availability varies by country and by subscription provider.*\r\n\u2022 Award-winning shows and movies that everyone's talking about like the HBO Original series The Last of Us, Succession, The White Lotus, House of the Dragon, and more.\r\n\u2022 Iconic favorite TV shows like Friends, South Park, Rick and Morty, 90-Day Fianc\u00e9, Fixer Upper, Beat Bobby Flay, House Hunters, Sesame Street, Looney Tunes, and more.\r\n\u2022 Family-friendly entertainment for the whole household.\r\n\u2022 Fascinating documentaries and unscripted series.\r\n\u2022 Enjoy your favorite shows and movies at home or on-the-go. Max is available on TV, web browser, mobile, tablet, and gaming console devices.\r\n\r\nFeatures: \r\n\u2022 Browse or search with ease across HBO, movies, series, genres, and brands. \r\n\u2022 Download shows and movies you love to watch on-the-go with select plans. (Download limits vary by plan.)\r\n\u2022 Personalized profiles for the entire family with customizable ratings, profile PIN protection, and kid-proof exit. \r\n\u2022 Pick up episodes and movies where you left off across your favorite devices. \r\n\u2022 Keep up with everything you love, all in one place with My Stuff. \r\n\u2022 Watch on multiple devices at the same time. (Limits vary by plan.)\r\n\u2022 Stream with high quality video and surround sound on select plans.\r\n\r\nContent and feature availability on Max may vary by region. Some titles and features shown above may not be available in your country. Language availability varies by country.\r\n\r\nYour subscription will automatically renew at the then-current price of your plan, unless you cancel before the renewal. You can manage or cancel your subscription at any time by accessing your account. Max is only available in certain territories.\r\n\r\n*Pricing and availability of the B/R Sports Add-On may vary by subscription provider.\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: https://max.com/terms-of-use/",
